      "decision": "The base retains the exact public dispatcher parameter and listen/notify roles; the changed derived constructor forwards that dispatcher in the original slot while its distinct animation argument is passed through resolveLegacyAnimationMode. The full dispatcher producer tests tagged 16 and current/21 public contracts; seven method bodies match tagged code except a specifically checked `_isDestroyed = true` addition before cleanup. A genuine dispatcher with replayed actual source methods demonstrates both listener removal and no queued focus after destruction in five subject contexts, and rejects missing removal or destruction/late-focus guards. Full old radio forwarding source and the changed derived caller transition are preserved. Owner-document focus and original dispatcher programs separately retain their complete old positive/negative controls on immutable historical subjects. Current tests use protocol receivers; actual component/node DI, native focus, packed consumer, floor and G11 remain separate."
